  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "方向约定",
      "items": [
        "emphasis 实线 = 写路径；dashed 虚线 = 只读读路径或回退车道",
        "每条边都取自调用点代码，不取 README 或 docs/ARCHITECTURE.md 的声明"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "默认导入车道不产生候选库",
      "items": [
        "ImportWorker 先用 planDirectSyncLane 选道；lane===\"direct\" 时直接对活库 var/rai.sqlite 落库，返回即 succeeded（import-worker.ts:554-624）",
        "record-only 快通路打开活库，PRAGMA synchronous=FULL 后原地提交（data-only-import.ts:133-143）",
        "统一接收器以 transactionOwner:\"caller\" 打开活库，事实 + 路线 + 分析任务登记同一条事务，store.commitCallerTransaction() 收尾（direct-sync-ingest.ts:426,449,613）",
        "两条直连车道都拒收才回退候选链路：建 rai.importing.<jobId>.sqlite 再原子 rename（import-worker.ts:617-624, 1718-1729）",
        "RAI_IMPORT_DATA_ONLY_FAST_PATH 默认为 \"1\"（server.ts:168-169）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "单写者与打开策略",
      "items": [
        "RaiDatabase 连接策略：foreign_keys=ON → busy_timeout=5000 → journal_mode=WAL（回读断言）→ synchronous=NORMAL（database.ts:1853-1875）",
        "MutationCoordinator.acquire 冲突抛 409 mutation_conflict；TaskAdmissionScheduler 让 CPU 重活全局只跑一个（task-admission.ts:9-39）",
        "API 以 migrationPolicy:\"refuse\" 打开主库：有未应用迁移即 PendingMigrationsError，启动期 exit 78（server.ts:579-588, 631-645）",
        "applyMutationCommand 在一条 BEGIN IMMEDIATE 内同时写业务效果与 import_manifest 回执 rai.applied-command.<id>（command-queue.ts:178-194）",
        "recompute worker 走共享内存写租约 withWriteGate，不逐处包事务（recompute-thread.ts:12-23）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "候选 vs 已提交（源码里的状态列）",
      "items": [
        "route_versions.status ∈ pending|complete|rejected；未完成版本对读侧不可见（v35-migration.ts:27, 14-15）",
        "import_batch_partitions.status ∈ pending|committed，分片逐块提交回执（v35-migration.ts:55）",
        "model_release_bundles.status ∈ passed|failed|not_evaluable；active_model_release 单例行才是生效指针（v2-migration.ts:29, 33-36）",
        "model_validation_gates.status 在 v24 由两态扩到含 not_evaluable（重建表 + 逐列拷贝，v24-migration.ts:34-55）",
        "候选库文件只有安装后通过 quick_check / 结构探针才保留，否则回滚 var/backups（import-worker.ts:1718-1729）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "表清单",
      "items": [
        "事实层：health_records · workouts · workout_statistics · workout_events · workout_routes · route_points · route_versions · route_version_points",
        "派生层：feature_runs · workout_features · model_runs · ability_assessments · daily_ability_snapshots · training_metric_runs · workout_training_loads · daily_training_metrics · canonical_nights · canonical_hrv_days",
        "任务/批次/账本层：recompute_jobs · recompute_job_events · prediction_model_runs · prediction_model_events · import_batches · import_batch_files · import_batch_partitions · schema_migrations · import_manifest · import_generations · import_fact_history",
        "发布层：model_validation_gates · model_release_refusals · model_checkpoints · recompute_validations · model_release_bundles · active_model_release · active_model_run · active_prediction_model",
        "运行时库：import_sources · import_jobs · mutation_commands · import_publications · runtime_meta",
        "控制库：mobile_goals · mobile_goals_history · mobile_plan_pushes · mobile_plan_operations · mobile_coach_loop_receipts"
